; markstep - the definition of certificates/programs/markstep-fp64.cfta,
; the golden corpus's replay case (docs/CERTIFICATES.md, "Golden
; certificates"; certificate format version 2). The image computes this
; map, step for step and flag for flag, except where its own test marks a
; lane (R24's raise with bit 7) - and there, once, it writes a wrong last
; bit. A version-2 certificate replays each marked lane by this source's
; reference interpreter and certifies the definition's values.
system markstep
format fp64
round  rne
state  k, x
param  a = 9/10, b = 1/7
next   k = k + 1
next   x = x * a + b
step   map
